{"author":"Valdemar1902","authorUid":"WIn1mNvYXGap5UlRvJXYeHahdYl1","remixOf":null,"description":"This is the standard byzantines 3 stone opener, which can be used against French, JD, Malians etc. This is very prone to early rushes, so stick to the mill opener in those matchups: https://aoe4guides.com/builds/D7Jsk12Fl2FCyiJf7q9L\n\nenjoy!","title":"Grand Winery 3 Stone Opener","steps":[{"age":1,"gameplan":"","type":"age","steps":[{"builders":"1","_id":1787072667675,"wood":"","food":"1","time":"0:00","stone":"3","description":"Split <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_worker/villager.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" />: 3 to <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_economy/mining-camp.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /><img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/resource_stone.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /> + 1 to <img src=\"https://aoe4guides.com/assets/pictures/building_economy/mining-camp.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /><img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/resource_gold.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /> + 1 to build <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_byzantines/cistern-1.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /> &amp; <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_economy/house.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /> and rest to <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/sheep.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /> until ageup","gold":"1"},{"gameplan":"Remember to build your cistern and hosue inside TC Range without blocking buildings later.","description":"","_id":1787072667676},{"gold":"1","food":"3","stone":"3","builders":"","time":"0:20","villagers":"","wood":"","_id":1787072667677,"description":"<img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/rally.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" title=\"Rally\" /><img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/sheep.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" title=\"Sheep\" /> until <img src=\"/assets/pictures/age/age_2.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" title=\"Feudal Age\" />"},{"time":"1:20","villagers":"","builders":"1","food":"6","wood":"","gold":"1","stone":"2","description":"Build 2nd <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_byzantines/cistern-1.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"Cistern\" /> and connect with <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_byzantines/aqueduct-1.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" />","_id":1787072667694},{"time":"2:38","villagers":"","builders":"1","food":"8","wood":"","gold":"1","stone":"3","description":"3rd <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_byzantines/cistern-1.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"Cistern\" />","_id":1787072667695}]},{"steps":[{"_id":1787072667679,"food":"9","time":"2:57","gold":"1","description":"Now take 4 <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/sheep.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /><img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_worker/villager.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /> and build <img src=\"/assets/pictures/landmark_byzantines/grand-winery-1.webp\" class=\"icon-landmark\" />","stone":"3"},{"time":"3:17","villagers":"","builders":"4","food":"4","wood":"5","gold":"1","stone":"-","description":"Take all <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_worker/villager.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"Villager\" /> off <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/resource_stone.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" title=\"Stone\" /> and go to <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/gaiatreeprototypetree.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /> + Build your 4th <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_byzantines/cistern-1.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" />","_id":1787072667696},{"gameplan":"You will get the final 100 <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/resource_stone.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" title=\"Stone\"> for the 5th cistern with the Landmark and buildings in early feudal. Then construct the 5th <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_byzantines/cistern-1.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"Cistern\"> on the 2nd <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/berrybush.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" title=\"Berries\"> ","_id":1787072667697,"description":""},{"description":"remacro and <img src=\"https://aoe4guides.com/assets/pictures/resource/rally.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /><img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/gaiatreeprototypetree.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /> until 8 on wood. Take <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/resource_gold.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /><img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_worker/villager.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /> to <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/gaiatreeprototypetree.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /> as well after you bank 35 gold for <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/limitanei-1.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" /> upgrade.","_id":1787072667680,"wood":"6","time":"3:20","villagers":"","stone":"3","builders":"4","food":"4","gold":"1"},{"time":"4:00","villagers":"","builders":"6","food":"5","wood":"8","gold":"","stone":"","description":"<img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_economy/house.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"House\" />","_id":1787072667698},{"time":"4:27","villagers":"","builders":"5","food":"6","wood":"8","gold":"","stone":"","description":"<img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_military/barracks.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" /> &amp; make <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/limitanei-1.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" /> constantly","_id":1787072667699}],"gameplan":"","age":1,"type":"ageUp"},{"type":"age","gameplan":"","steps":[{"description":"Put all <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/resource_food.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" /><img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_worker/villager.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /> on <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/berrybush.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" title=\"Berries\" /> by the <img src=\"/assets/pictures/landmark_byzantines/grand-winery-1.webp\" class=\"icon-landmark\" title=\"Grand Winery\" />","wood":"8","_id":1787072667681,"food":"9","time":"4:38","builders":"1"},{"time":"4:50","villagers":"","builders":"1","food":"10","wood":"8","gold":"","stone":"","description":"<img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_byzantines/mercenary-house-2.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" title=\"Mercenary House\" /> and contract: <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/javelin-thrower-2.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" title=\"Javelin Thrower\" /> if against knight civs, and <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/longbowman-2.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" title=\"Longbowman\" /> as default. ","_id":1787072667700},{"_id":1787072667684,"gameplan":"For now, stay in your base, and start securing 2nd and 3rd berries after each other with your infantry units, while your horsemen are raiding. If your opponent is playing greedy like FC or 2TC, then you pull infantry fwd and make <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/cheirosiphon-3.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" title=\"Cheirosiphon\"> and find timing. If they are playing 1tc aggression, then you just focus on making units and aging to castle at 12 mins.","description":""},{"time":"5:55","villagers":"","builders":"","food":"12","wood":"8","gold":"3","stone":"","description":"<img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/longbowman-2.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" title=\"Longbowman\" /> in queue","_id":1787072667701},{"food":"13","villagers":"","gold":"4","builders":"","description":"<img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_technology/blacksmith.webp\" class=\"icon-tech\" title=\"Blacksmith\" /> and queue <img src=\"/assets/pictures/technology_military/steeled-arrow.webp\" class=\"icon-tech\" title=\"Steeled Arrow\" /><img src=\"/assets/pictures/technology_military/iron-undermesh.webp\" class=\"icon-tech\" />","wood":"8","_id":1787072667687,"time":"6:00","stone":""},{"time":"7:00","villagers":"","builders":"","food":"14","wood":"8","gold":"5","stone":"","description":"Start building <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_defensive/outpost.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"Outpost\" /> &amp; <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_economy/mill.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /> + 5th <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_byzantines/cistern-1.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /> on 2nd <img src=\"/assets/pictures/resource/berrybush.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" title=\"Berries\" /> with 5 <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_worker/villager.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"Villager\" />","_id":1787072667702},{"_id":1787072667688,"food":"13","builders":"","gold":"5","villagers":"","description":"2nd <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/longbowman-2.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" />","wood":"8","stone":"","time":"7:08"},{"villagers":"","gold":"5","food":"18","stone":"","_id":1787072667689,"description":" <img src=\"/assets/pictures/technology_economy/wheelbarrow.webp\" class=\"icon-tech\" />","time":"8:18","wood":"6","builders":""},{"time":"8:30","villagers":"","builders":"","food":"18","wood":"6","gold":"5","stone":"","description":"3rd <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/longbowman-2.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" title=\"Longbowman\" />","_id":1787072667703},{"_id":1787072667690,"description":"","gameplan":"Every time you secure a resource, do it with 5 <img src=\"/assets/pictures/unit_worker/villager.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"Villager\"> and build an <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_defensive/outpost.webp\" class=\"icon-default\"> to house all of them in case of raids to buy you time to respond. Think of <img src=\"/assets/pictures/building_defensive/outpost.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" title=\"Outpost\"> as delays, that give you time to defend with units."},{"description":"11 mins in you stop making units and macro towards castle age with 2-3 on wood and rest on food and gold","stone":"","_id":1787072667691,"wood":"3","time":"11:00","builders":"","villagers":"","food":"23","gold":"12"}],"age":2},{"age":2,"gameplan":"","steps":[{"gold":"15","description":"Build  <img src=\"https://aoe4guides.com/assets/pictures/landmark_byzantines/golden-horn-tower-2.webp\" class=\"icon-landmark\" /> with 8-12 vills and <img src=\"https://aoe4guides.com/assets/pictures/building_military/stable.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" />. Keep gathering wood for <img src=\"https://aoe4guides.com/assets/pictures/building_religious/monastery.webp\" class=\"icon-default\" /> and then start making <img src=\"https://aoe4guides.com/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/cataphract-3.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" /> + <img src=\"https://aoe4guides.com/assets/pictures/unit_byzantines/longbowman-2.webp\" class=\"icon-military\" title=\"Longbowman\" /> and take <img src=\"https://aoe4guides.com/assets/pictures/resource/relics.webp\" class=\"icon-none\" />. This is also crucial timing for attack since your upgrades come in very rapidly with Byz cistern scaling, so find dmg! GL!","time":"","food":"23","wood":"3","_id":1787072667692}],"type":"ageUp"},{"type":"age","steps":[{"description":"","_id":1787072667623}],"gameplan":"","age":3}],"civ":"BYZ","map":"","season":"Season 13","strategy":"Timing Attack","isDraft":false,"likes":0,"comments":0,"scoreAllTime":0,"timeCreated":{"_seconds":1787074703,"_nanoseconds":134000000},"ageTimings":{"feudal":{"t":278,"e":false},"castle":{"t":785,"e":true}},"id":"dbmBFjUqxyRYFSWCVHXH","sortTitle":"grand winery 3 stone opener9803d1b9-86fa-4c7b-9e7c-8889ac82d9fb","timeUpdated":{"_seconds":1787074954,"_nanoseconds":544000000},"creatorId":"UCyzgM7IMV8AXN8suRSyNhiQ","creatorName":"Valdemar","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0pkvLN16f4o","upvotes":1,"score":4.204692619390966,"views":112}